                            	  7029: UpdateDodongoState_JumpTable:
02:0003C878 0003C884        	  7030:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState0_Move   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003C87C 0003C8FA        	  7031:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003C880 0003C8E2        	  7032:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState2_Stunned   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
