                            	  3966: _L_z07_WieldFlute_Found:
                            	  3967:     ; Found.
                            	  3968:     ;
                            	  3969:     ; If it was the first room in the list, handle it specially.
                            	  3970:     ; This room is the only one in Q1 with a flute secret. It's also
                            	  3971:     ; the only one in the list without a flute secret in Q2.
                            	  3972:     ;
                            	  3973:     ; In Q2, go summon the whirlwind. In Q1, continue to reveal
                            	  3974:     ; the secret.
                            	  3975:     ;
